But in the unconscious, everything is muddled. It's like really like a dark room. You don't know where one thing starts and the other one stops. So when you get one thing, you, it's like a string of clothes where you can't just put out one thing, but you pull out everything.

00:32:37.680 --> 00:32:56.291
So when people encounter their unconscious, they become in contact with a lot of archaic images, as I said, from the collective unconscious, or also infantile material or repressed material. And this plays into the shadow aspect.

