He also noticed that highly intuitive people have kind of a veiled look, that you're not quite sure where they're looking at, or that they rather look through things because they're experiencing all the possibilities, but not the concrete thing in front of their eyes. They're just touching the ground for very short moments.

00:34:34.510 --> 00:34:47.624
